<h1 id="background-and-topics">Background and Topics</h1>

<p>Android has grown from a humble mobile operating system into a ubiquitous platform connecting many kinds of user devices across the world. In this rapidly changing ecosystem,We sincerely invite experts and scholars in relevant fields to discuss the security issues in the field of Android.</p>

